statement.en:
Solve the system of equations for integer values of $x$ and $y$:
\begin{align*}
\sqrt{x}+y&=7\\
x+\sqrt{y}&=11
\end{align*}
Find the sum of all possible values of $(x+y)$. ($\sqrt{36}=\sqrt{6\times 6}=\sqrt{6^{2}}=6$)

